# One row per shipped asset, in this order of columns:
#   path | license | origin | prompt-id | model | date | shaped-by | notes
# path: relative to assets/. license: CC-BY-4.0 or reserved (RESERVED.md).
# origin: hand-made | generated-and-shaped | generated-raw (accepted untouched;
#   the copyright claim on it is doubtful and the disclosure says so).
# prompt-id: the prompt file under assets/refs/<family>/ a generated asset
#   came from, else -. model: the generator, else -; a generated origin
#   needs both, a hand-made one has neither. date: YYYY-MM-DD, the day the
#   file was made (hand) or shaped (pipeline), which is also the day it
#   landed in the tree. shaped-by: hand | pipeline (scripts/art/shape) | David.
# The gate test/test-assets.sgl derives both directions from the tree:
# every file under assets/ (refs/, src/ and these three files excepted)
# has a row here, and every row names a file. scripts/art/manifest-add
# appends a row.
